Wrap the Input Prompt within a timeout block set for 1 DAY.

Example syntax to add in the Jenkinsfile:
 stage('Deploy to Prod?') {
  when {
    branch 'main'
        }
  steps {
    timeout(time: 1, unit: 'DAYS') {
      input message: 'Is the PR Merged and ArgoCD Synced?', ok: 'YES! PR is Merged and ArgoCD Application is Synced', submitter: 'admin'
    }
  }
  }
Commit the Changes to the repository.

   git add Jenkinsfile
   git commit -m "Add Deploy to Prod? stage with input directive"
   git push origin feature/enabling-cicd
Merge the PR to the main branch.

Verify the Pipeline Execution:

Trigger the Jenkins pipeline.
The pipeline should await input at the Deploy to Prod? stage.
